TRUE removed from and:
  in : (and (W:p a) TRUE)
  status: 1
  out: (W:p a)
FALSE collapses and:
  in : (and (W:p a) FALSE)
  status: 1
  out: FALSE
TRUE collapses or:
  in : (or (W:p a) TRUE)
  status: 1
  out: TRUE
FALSE removed from or:
  in : (or (W:p a) FALSE)
  status: 1
  out: (W:p a)
singleton and unwrapped:
  in : (and (W:p a))
  status: 1
  out: (W:p a)
nested and flattened:
  in : (and (W:p a) (and (W:q a) (W:q b)))
  status: 1
  out: (and (W:p a) (W:q a) (W:q b))
no change:
